{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Exemplar pages for style only (rhythm, line shapes, joke mechanisms, hooks). Each book gets a seeded subset; each chapter call shows 2 that match its beats. The writer is told never to copy content or wording; tools/metrics.py flags any ≥6-字 span copied from here. Keep every page ≤80 字 and ≤5 lines. Characters vary on purpose; none of these is a storyline from seeds.json.",
  "pages": [
    {"id": "e01", "beat": "open", "opening": "sfx", "mechanism": "suspense",
     "lines": [{"k": "sfx", "text": "咚！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "一个松果砸在熊二的脑门上。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "xionger", "text": "谁？谁扔的？"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "树上没有松鼠。只有一个松果，正慢吞吞地往天上掉。"}]},
    {"id": "e02", "beat": "open", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "boast_undercut",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "qiang", "text": "今天，我要砍够一百棵！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "光头强数了一遍：九十九棵。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "又数了一遍：还是九十九棵。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "qiang", "text": "第一百棵……溜哪儿去了？"}]},
    {"id": "e03", "beat": "open", "opening": "image", "mechanism": "suspense",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "吉吉国王的宝座上，多了一顶帽子。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "帽子是倒着放的，里面装满了香蕉皮。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "jiji", "text": "本王的宝座，谁敢坐过？"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "帽子里传出一声小小的饱嗝。"}]},
    {"id": "e04", "beat": "rule", "opening": "action", "mechanism": "refrain",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "小铃铛每响一下，就有一样东西变成甜的。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "叮——石头变成了软糖。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "叮——树叶变成了饼干。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "xionger", "text": "第三下，第三下变俺的鼻子吧！"}]},
    {"id": "e05", "beat": "rule", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "absurd_logic",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "zhaolin", "text": "我的日记本上写着：彩虹桥只让说实话的人走。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "qiang", "text": "那还不简单。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "光头强一脚踩上去。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "qiang", "text": "我……我其实有点怕高。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "桥稳稳的，一动不动。"}]},
    {"id": "e06", "beat": "try_fail", "opening": "action", "mechanism": "reversal",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "熊大搬来一块大石头，压住了魔法帽子。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "xiongda", "text": "这下它哪儿也去不了。"}, {"k": "sfx", "text": "噗。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "帽子没动。石头飞走了。"}]},
    {"id": "e07", "beat": "try_fail", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "boast_undercut",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "jiji", "text": "本王命令你，停下！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "风没有停。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "jiji", "text": "本王……本王改主意了，你可以接着吹。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "风停了。"}]},
    {"id": "e08", "beat": "try_fail", "opening": "sfx", "mechanism": "slapstick",
     "lines": [{"k": "sfx", "text": "嗡——嗡——"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "光头强的“自动采蜜机”开动了。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "它采到了蜂蜜。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "它还采到了蜜蜂。一整窝。"}]},
    {"id": "e09", "beat": "consequence", "opening": "action", "mechanism": "warmth",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "熊二把耳朵贴在树洞上，一动不动。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "里面有个细细的声音在数数：一、二、三……数到七，就哭了。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "xionger", "text": "熊大，树洞里的小东西，数不到八。"}]},
    {"id": "e10", "beat": "consequence", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "misunderstanding",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "xiongda", "text": "熊二，盯紧那只狐狸，别让它溜了。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "熊二盯着狐狸，一眨也不眨。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "狐狸往左，熊二的眼睛往左。狐狸往右，熊二的眼睛往右。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "狐狸走远了。熊二还在盯着那个方向。"}]},
    {"id": "e11", "beat": "consequence", "opening": "sfx", "mechanism": "silly_payoff",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "熊二也对着草丛打了个喷嚏。"}, {"k": "sfx", "text": "阿——嚏！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "草丛愣了一下，回了一个更小的喷嚏。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "一大一小，你一个，我一个，像在比赛。"}]},
    {"id": "e12", "beat": "escalate", "opening": "image", "mechanism": "refrain",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "熊二拉着萝卜，熊大拉着熊二，光头强拉着熊大。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "jiji", "text": "一、二、三——本王宣布，加油！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "萝卜纹丝不动。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "吉吉国王的嗓子，倒是喊哑了。"}]},
    {"id": "e13", "beat": "escalate", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "boast_undercut",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "qiang", "text": "我造的飞行器，绝对、肯定、百分之百——"}, {"k": "sfx", "text": "噗噜噜……"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "它飞起来了。飞了三步远。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "然后挂在一棵树上，再也不肯下来。"}]},
    {"id": "e14", "beat": "escalate", "opening": "question", "mechanism": "suspense",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "zhaolin", "text": "你们听见了吗？"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "大家都竖起耳朵。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "没有鸟叫，没有风声，连熊二的肚子都没叫。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "xionger", "text": "俺的肚子……也被偷走声音啦？"}]},
    {"id": "e15", "beat": "motive", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "irony",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "tiancaiwei", "text": "洞洞幺，记录：月亮宝宝，亮度九百九十九。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "tiancaiwei", "text": "有了它，发明大赛的冠军就是我的。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "dongdongyao", "text": "主人……它好像在哭。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "tiancaiwei", "text": "那是反光。……大概是。"}]},
    {"id": "e16", "beat": "motive", "opening": "sfx", "mechanism": "phone_stinger",
     "lines": [{"k": "sfx", "text": "叮铃铃——"}, {"k": "say", "who": "libanban", "text": "光头强！我的木头呢？"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "光头强看看怀里的小树苗，捂住了话筒。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "qiang", "text": "喂？喂？信号不好——"}]},
    {"id": "e17", "beat": "motive", "opening": "action", "mechanism": "villain_duo",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "damahou", "text": "二狗，听好了，这叫陷阱。陷——阱。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "ergou", "text": "我懂！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "二狗一脚踩了进去。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "ergou", "text": "……我现在更懂了。"}]},
    {"id": "e18", "beat": "lowpoint", "opening": "image", "mechanism": "quiet",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "雪停了。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "蜂蜜罐空了，地图被风刮走了。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "熊二坐在雪地里，没有哼歌。"}]},
    {"id": "e19", "beat": "lowpoint", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "quiet",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "xiongda", "text": "都怪我。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "熊大说完这三个字，就不说话了。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "熊二把最后一口蜂蜜，推到了他面前。"}]},
    {"id": "e20", "beat": "quiet", "opening": "action", "mechanism": "planted_detail",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "熊大翻遍了背包。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "背包底下粘着一片红叶子——是早上熊二硬塞给他的那片。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "xiongda", "text": "熊二，你的叶子，怎么在发烫？"}]},
    {"id": "e21", "beat": "turn", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "planted_payoff",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "xionger", "text": "俺有办法啦！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "熊二举起那个空蜂蜜罐，对着山谷大喊一声。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "山谷把声音装进罐子，又“咕嘟”一下吐了回来。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "这回，是三个熊二一起喊。"}]},
    {"id": "e22", "beat": "turn", "opening": "image", "mechanism": "smallest_helps",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "大家都拉累了，坐在地上喘气。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "毛毛悄悄走到萝卜跟前，挠了一下萝卜的痒痒。"}, {"k": "sfx", "text": "噗哧！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "萝卜笑得一抖，自己从土里蹦了出来。"}]},
    {"id": "e23", "beat": "climax", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "refrain_flip",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "xionger", "text": "一、二、三——"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "这一回，没有人喊“拔”。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "xionger", "text": "松——手！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "绳子一松，云朵“呼”地回到了天上。"}]},
    {"id": "e24", "beat": "climax", "opening": "sfx", "mechanism": "slapstick",
     "lines": [{"k": "sfx", "text": "啵——！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "大萝卜出来了。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "拉萝卜的、拉熊的、拉尾巴的，全坐在了地上。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "吉吉国王坐在最上面，王冠歪到了耳朵边。"}]},
    {"id": "e25", "beat": "resolve", "opening": "action", "mechanism": "warmth_object",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "光头强没说谢谢。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "他把那只修好的小木凳，放在了树洞门口。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "凳子腿上，刻着两个歪歪扭扭的熊脑袋。"}]},
    {"id": "e26", "beat": "resolve", "opening": "say", "mechanism": "warmth_object",
     "lines": [{"k": "say", "who": "jiji", "text": "本王只是路过。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "吉吉国王路过的时候，把一根香蕉留在了毛毛的床上。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "剥好了皮的。"}]},
    {"id": "e27", "beat": "echo", "opening": "sfx", "mechanism": "callback",
     "lines": [{"k": "sfx", "text": "咚！"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "第二天早上，又一个松果砸在熊二的脑门上。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "这一回，松果是往下掉的。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "xionger", "text": "嗯……还是往下掉的好吃。"}]},
    {"id": "e28", "beat": "echo", "opening": "image", "mechanism": "callback",
     "lines": [{"k": "narr", "text": "光头强又数了一遍：一百棵。"}, {"k": "narr", "text": "第一百棵站在最边上，枝头挂着他的安全帽。"}, {"k": "say", "who": "qiang", "text": "行，那顶帽子……就借你戴吧。"}]}
  ]
}
